{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20260806/photo/bkn-20260806161054430-0806_00992_001_01p.jpg?20260806162647\"/><p>北韓過去試射火星17洲際彈道導彈。</p><p>南韓聯合參謀本部周四（6日）公布，北韓向朝鮮半島東部海域發射不明飛行器。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T08:40:21.614568+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":62,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"}}